## Description

Gasoline is available at only 28% of gas stations in Russia  A week earlier, this figure stood at 41%.  Russia is facing a second, more severe wave of the fuel crisis.  Due to the shortage of fuel, gasoline prices at gas stations in the regions have soared 1.8–2 times. https://t.co/Lj6ZxbpPkl

